{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c1ec7e4f-3f85-4ce0-98d9-adorzotno-ecommerce-api",
    "name": "Adorzotno Ecommerce API",
    "description": "Customer-facing ecommerce API for Adorzotno.\n\nAuthentication uses Laravel Sanctum bearer tokens. Call `Auth / Login` or `Auth / Register`, copy the returned `data.token` into the `api_token` collection variable, then call protected endpoints.\n\nCommon response shape:\n- `status`: `success` or `error`\n- `message`: human-readable message\n- `data`: response payload\n- `errors`: validation or error details\n\nProduct payloads include `selling_price`, `stock`, `available_stock`, and `in_stock` values calculated from live SKU stock balances. SKU payloads include their own `selling_price` and stock summaries. Wishlist, order list, and order details responses include the same decorated nested SKU/product selling price fields.\n\nCollection variables:\n- `base_url`: API base URL\n- `api_token`: Sanctum bearer token for authenticated requests\n- `product_slug`, `category_slug`, `brand_slug`: helper slugs for storefront endpoints\n- `product_id`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `order_id`, `review_id`, `sku_id`, `banner_id`, `faq_id`: helper IDs for quick testing",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
